millerx (0.6.5) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Archives: Extract here / Extract to a folder, and Compress… to zip,
    tar.gz, tar.xz, tar.zst or 7z, with libarchive (no new dependency).
    Entries with absolute paths or ".." are refused.
  * Slackware: every release now carries a ready-built .txz (built on 15.0).

